  aciklama:
  - "Senin i\xE7in yakt\u0131\u011F\u0131m ate\u015Fin alevi ba\u015Flarda \xE7ok
    dura\u011Fand\u0131. Sonra birden ileri geri yatmaya ba\u015Flad\u0131. G\xF6r\xFC\u015Ft\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    ki\u015Fiyle birbirinize hen\xFCz tam manas\u0131yla a\xE7\u0131lmam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n\u0131z
    siz {{isim}}. Yak\u0131nda kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131kl\u0131 olarak seri \u015Fekilde
    itiraflarda bulunacaks\u0131n\u0131z. Mesle\u011Finde de seni hareketlendirecek
    g\xFCzel bir geli\u015Fme olacak. \u0130\u015Fine kar\u015F\u0131 yeniden heyecan
    duymaya ba\u015Flayacaks\u0131n."
